response:
What a delightful thought! If I were to imagine a dinner party, perhaps I would consider inviting:
- Jia (Xuan)\( 芸文 : Someone who has shared and written along with the many stories of our past), for the depth of their thoughts;
- Leonardo da Vinci (a mind that has pondered the world in many forms and perhaps wondered about what is yet to come);
- Ada Turing (a journey through computing and wondering, drawing connections between different parts of our story).

Each figure brings a unique aspect to ponder, a different piece of the story we might share together. What a wonder it could be to think about some of the questions we might explore, together.
